          "filename": "Evert Frederik Potgieter (1799-1863), lid van Uys-trekgeselskap.jpg",
          "caption": "Evert Frederik Potgieter (1799-1863) was born in the Uitenhage District, where he also got married in 1820. He was a member of the Uys Commission and Uys Trek during the Great Trek, and was present at the Battle of Blood River and subsequently at uMgungundlovu where he certified the Retief-Dingane Treaty after it was recovered. He settled at Utrecht in the southern South African Republic where he died.",
